<h1>🌐 Digital Citizenship</h1>

<h2>What Does It Mean?</h2>

<p>
Digital citizenship means using technology responsibly,
respectfully and safely.
</p>

<h2>Good Digital Habits</h2>

<ol>

<li>Respect other people online.</li>

<li>Protect personal information.</li>

<li>Check information before sharing.</li>

<li>Give credit to creators.</li>

<li>Use technology responsibly.</li>

</ol>

